msgid ""
"If your only keyboard and mouse are *not* connected through a :doc:`USB qube "
"</user/advanced-topics/usb-qubes>`, or that USB qube is *not* a disposable, "
"then shut down all disposables. In the App Menu, go to Qubes Tools, then "
"click on Qube Manager. In the Qube Manager, find your disposable "
"template(s). (By default, they end in ``-dvm``.) Right click, hover over "
