"template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/templates.rst:172 30303030cb4a40d88cf22bde8e0f0094
msgid ""
"If your only keyboard or mouse *are* connected through a USB qube, and that "
"USB qube *is* a disposable, then you will have to enter a special command "
"that shuts down all of your qubes, switches the USB qube’s disposable "
"template to the new template, then starts the USB qube again. In order to "
"avoid being locked out of your system, you must be very careful to enter "
"this command without typos and with the correct substitutions."
msgstr ""

